# Pummel Health Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Pummel Health.

Pummel Health is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token and EOSIO smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Pummel Health  
Audit type: Token smart contract audit and EOSIO contract review  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

